    "splashDescription": "Capgemini's Agentic Financial Crime Compliance (FCC) Transaction Monitoring Solution with Camunda empowers financial institutions to modernize their transaction monitoring systems with agentic AI/ML models, seamless process automation, and real-time risk detection. By addressing the biggest challenges in anti-money laundering (AML) compliance, this solution ensures stronger regulatory alignment, improved operational resilience, and enhanced fraud prevention capabilities, paving the way for a more secure and efficient financial ecosystem.",
